s=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7463em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.0242em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.2242em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5842em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6684em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.5842em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.31em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.71em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9684em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1684em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.0842em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.5842em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[14]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{nu\\_1, nu\\_2, nu\\_3} & \\left\\{-2\\,h-\\mathrm{th}+u,-h-\\mathrm{th}+u,u-\\mathrm{th}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{qdet = nu\\_1\\^{}[-4] nu\\_2\\^{}[-2] nu\\_3 (deg 3 = 3L)} & -8\\,h^2\\,\\mathrm{th}+8\\,h^2\\,u-6\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}^2+12\\,h\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u-6\\,h\\,u^2-\\mathrm{th}^3+3\\,\\mathrm{th}^2\\,u-3\\,\\mathrm{th}\\,u^2+u^3\\\\\\hline\\text{M = mu/nu\\_1} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{E\\_2 = mu/(nu\\_1 nu\\_1\\^{}[-2]) has 4 poles, M has 3} & \\left\\{\\left(\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\,\\left(h+\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,h+\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\,\\left(3\\,h+\\mathrm{th}-u\\right),\\left(\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\,\\left(h+\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\,\\left(2\\,h+\\mathrm{th}-u\\right)\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{poles of M} & \\left\\{\\mathrm{th},h+\\mathrm{th},2\\,h+\\mathrm{th}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{residue weights} & \\left\\{\\frac{1}{2\\,h^2},-\\frac{1}{h^2},\\frac{1}{2\\,h^2}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{weights = 1/prod\\_\\{p'!=p\\}(p-p')} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{sum of weights vanishes (M \\textasciitilde{} u\\^{}-3)} & 0\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d8925c52-9f18-4dea-aae2-c626f4b64d91"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. The three columns\n\n`Delta T_1 = Delta c_1` is a constant and `Delta T_2 = Delta s_2 u + Delta c_2` is linear, so the split\n\n$$\\Delta T_2 \\;=\\; \\nu_1^{[-2]}\\delta_1 + \\nu_3\\,\\delta_2,\\qquad \\nu_1^{[-2]} = u-\\theta-3h,\\quad \\nu_3 = u-\\theta$$\n\nhas **constant** `delta_1 = a_1`, `delta_2 = a_2`, and is unique because `3h != 0`. Starting from\n\n$$0 \\;=\\; \\Big\\langle \\mu\\, Q^j_A\\big(\\mathcal O_A-\\mathcal O_B\\big) Q_i^{B[2]}\\Big\\rangle \\;=\\; \\Big\\langle -\\tfrac{\\Delta T_1}{\\nu_1} Q^j_A Q^B_i + \\tfrac{\\Delta T_2}{\\nu_1\\nu_1^{[-2]}} Q^j_A Q_i^{B[-2]}\\Big\\rangle_\\mu$$\n\nand using `mu/nu_1 = M`, `mu/(nu_1 nu_1^{[-2]}) = E_2`, `E_2 nu_1^{[-2]} = M`, and the full-contour shift `u -> u+h` on the `E_2 nu_3` term (whose poles are `theta+h, theta+2h, theta+3h`), one gets a **three**-column identity\n\n$$0 \\;=\\; \\sum_{c=1}^{3} w'_c \\,\\langle G_c\\rangle_M ,\\qquad w' = (\\Delta c_1,\\ a_1,\\ a_2),$$\n\n$$G_1 = -Q^j Q_i,\\qquad G_2 = Q^j Q_i^{[-2]},\\qquad G_3 = Q^{j[2]} Q_i .$$\n\nAt L=1 the shifted term carries the shift on the **dual** and leaves the direct unshifted, exactly as `G_5, G_6` at L=2, but `delta_2^{[2]} = a_2` is constant so no `(u+h)` prefactor survives.\n\nFrom here on `Q_i` and `Q^j` are undetermined symbols `QU[i][.]` and `QD[j][.]`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 2a. Split of DeltaT2, and an honest check that the E2-form and the M-form of the identity agree term by term. ---- *)\nClearAll[splitT2, polesE2, reswE2, bracketE2, colFunsM, arbCheck, tp];\n(* DeltaT2 = a1 nu1[u-h] + a2 nu3[u]: two constants for a linear DeltaT2 *)\nsplitT2[dT2_] := Module[{c1, c2, s},\n   s = First@Solve[Thread[CoefficientList[Expand[dT2], u] == CoefficientList[Expand[c1 nu1[u - h] + c2 nu3[u]], u]], {c1, c2}];\n   {c1, c2} /. s];\npolesE2 = th + h Range[0, 3];\nreswE2 = Table[Together[Residue[E2meas[x], {x, p}]], {p, polesE2}];\nbracketE2[F_] := reswE2 . Map[F, polesE2];\n(* the three column integrands G_1, G_2, G_3 for dual Qa and direct Qb; w' = (Dc1, a1, a2) *)\ncolFunsM[Qa_, Qb_] := {Function[y, -Qa[y] Qb[y]], Function[y, Qa[y] Qb[y - h]], Function[y, Qa[y + h] Qb[y]]};\n(* term-by-term rewriting for ARBITRARY constant dT1 and linear dT2, on arbitrary test functions Qa (dual), Qb (direct) *)\narbCheck[Qa_, Qb_, dT1_, dT2_] := Module[{ab = splitT2[dT2], old, new},\n   old = bracketE2[Function[y, Qa[y] (-dT1 nu1[y - h] Qb[y] + (dT2 /. u -> y) Qb[y - h])]];\n   new = Join[{dT1}, ab] . (bracketM /@ colFunsM[Qa, Qb]);\n   Together[old - new]];\ntp = {Function[y, 3 y^4 - 2 y^3 + y - 5], Function[y, y^5 + 7 y^2 - 2], Function[y, y^3 - y^2 + 11], Function[y, 2 y^6 - y + 1]};\nGrid[{\n  {\"split of a generic linear DeltaT2 = ds2 u + dc2\", Simplify[splitT2[ds2 u + dc2]]},\n  {\"check: nu1^[-2] a1 + nu3 a2 reproduces it\", Simplify[Expand[splitT2[ds2 u + dc2] . {nu1[u - h], nu3[u]} - (ds2 u + dc2)]] === 0},\n  {\"E_2 poles (4)\", polesE2},\n  {\"E_2 -> M rewriting, 16 test pairs, dT1 = 5/7, dT2 = (3/4)u - 2/9\", Simplify[Flatten@Table[arbCheck[qa, qb, 5/7, (3/4) u - 2/9], {qa, tp}, {qb, tp}]] === ConstantArray[0, 16]},\n  {\"same with symbolic dT1, dT2\", Simplify[arbCheck[tp[[1]], tp[[2]], dc1, ds2 u + dc2]] === 0}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639557\" data-output-id=\"9\" data-out-n=\"31\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[31]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"33\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.0801em;vertical-align:-2.7701em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.3101em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.2701em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2701em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.0401em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.7701em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2701em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.3899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">split of a generic linear DeltaT2 = ds2 u + dc2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.1899em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">check: nu1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></