  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Independent wave-function bases, and the Schmidt rank of det N. ---- *)\n(* NB: pivots via Position[Unitize[row], 1] — the idiom Position[v, _?(# =!= 0 &)] misbehaves here (see the L=2 notebook's pitfalls). *)\nClearAll[coefMat, indepIdx, zeroConfs, basIdxB, basIdxA, schmidt];\ncoefMat[polys_] := Module[{vs, mons},\n   vs = Union@Cases[polys, qu[_, _] | qd[_, _], Infinity];\n   mons = Union@Flatten[First /@ CoefficientRules[#, vs] & /@ polys, 1];\n   {mons, Table[Lookup[Association[CoefficientRules[p, vs]], Key /@ mons, 0], {p, polys}]}];\nindepIdx[polys_] := Module[{m = Last[coefMat[polys]], rr},\n   rr = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Transpose[m]], {0 ..}];\n   Flatten[First@Position[Unitize[#], 1] & /@ rr]];\nzeroConfs = Select[Range[Length[confs]], PsiB[confs[[#]]] === 0 &];\nbasIdxB = indepIdx[PsiB /@ confs];\nbasIdxA = indepIdx[PsiA /@ confs];\n(* Schmidt rank of det N as an element of (dual cubics) tensor (direct cubics) *)\nschmidt[tr_] := Module[{ss = splitSides[detN[tr]]}, MatrixRank[Last[coefMat[Values[ss]]]]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"configs {x21,x11,x22} with Psi^B = 0 (x11 = x22 - h)\", confs[[zeroConfs]]},\n  {\"dim span Psi^B, dim span Psi^A (of 27 configs)\", {Length[basIdxB], Length[basIdxA]}},\n  {\"an independent set of B configs\", confs[[basIdxB]]},\n  {\"Schmidt rank of det N, per candidate triple\", Table[schmidt[tr], {tr, cand}]}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
