</span></span><span class=\"mord\">B = 0 (x11 = x22 - h)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-19.6601em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim span Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">B, dim span Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">A (of 27 configs)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.8501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">an independent set of B configs</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.9401em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:12.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Schmidt rank of det N, per candidate triple</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.7501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:30.0002em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-rig