 class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:14.7501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[88]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{configs \\{x21,x11,x22\\} with Psi\\^{}B = 0 (x11 = x22 - h)} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 1\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\1 & 0 & 1\\\\1 & 1 & 2\\\\2 & 0 & 1\\\\2 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{dim span Psi\\^{}B, dim span Psi\\^{}A (of 27 configs)} & \\left\\{17,17\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{an independent set of B configs} & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 0\\\\0 & 2 & 0\\\\0 & 2 & 1\\\\0 & 2 & 2\\\\1 & 0 & 0\\\\1 & 0 & 2\\\\1 & 1 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 0\\\\1 & 2 & 1\\\\1 & 2 & 2\\\\2 & 0 & 0\\\\2 & 1 & 0\\\\2 & 2 & 0\\\\2 & 2 & 1\\\\2 & 2 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{Schmidt rank of det N, per candidate triple} & \\left\\{16,16,16,16\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "33be61fd-89d9-4465-ba02-454941c0470c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 7. The 27 terms of the multilinear expansion factor into (dual cubic) x (direct cubic). Identify both factors. ---- *)\nClearAll[termOf, splitFactor, lookB, lookA, idB, idA, termTab];\ntrGood = {{1, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 1}};\ntermOf[{n1_, n2_, n3_}] := Expand[Det[{gvec[trGood[[1]], n1], gvec[trGood[[2]], n2], gvec[trGood[[3]], n3]}]];\n(* every term is a product; separate the qd-part from the qu-part *)\nsplitFactor[e_] := Module[{f = FactorList[e], dpart = 1, upart = 1},\n   Do[If[FreeQ[t[[1]], qu], dpart *= t[[1]]^t[[2]], upart *= t[[1]]^t[[2]]], {t, f}];\n   {Expand[dpart], Expand[upart]}];\n(* lookup tables: which (x21,x11,x22) reproduce a given cubic, up to sign *)\nlookB = Association@Flatten@Table[{Expand[PsiB[{a, b, c}]] -> {{a, b, c}, 1}, Expand[-PsiB[{a, b, c}]] -> {{a, b, c}, -1}}, {a, -1, 3}, {b, -1, 3}, {c, -1, 3}];\nlookA = Association@Flatten@Table[{Expand[PsiA[{a, b, c}]] -> {{a, b, c}, 1}, Expand[-PsiA[{a, b, c}]] -> {{a, b, c}, -1}}, {a, -1, 3}, {b, -1, 3}, {c, -1, 3}];\nidB[p_] := Lookup[lookB, Expand[p], \"not a Psi^B\"];\nidA[p_] := Lookup[lookA, Expand[p], \"not a Psi^A\"];\ntermTab = Flatten[Table[Module[{sf = splitFactor[termOf[{n1, n2, n3}]]},\n     {{n1, n2, n3}, idA[sf[[1]]], idB[sf[[2]]]}], {n1, 0, 2}, {n2, 0, 2}, {n3, 0, 2}], 2];\nGrid[Prepend[termTab, {\"(n1,n2,n3)\", \"dual factor as Psi^A\", \"direct factor as Psi^B\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
