\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.205em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.005em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">78</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.605em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO SOLUTION</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6.01em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.755em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.255em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.755em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[80]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{triples with correct Q-content (both multisets \\{1,1,2\\})} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{1,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{1,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{diagonal terms n1=n2=n3 equal m\\_n\\^{}3 Psi\\^{}A(n,n,n) Psi\\^{}B(n,n,n)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# monomials in det N, in the diagonal part, in the remainder} & \\left\\{78,12,70\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{remainder vanishes?} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{det N = sum\\_x m(x) Psi\\^{}A(x) Psi\\^{}B(x) solvable for any weights?} & \\text{NO SOLUTION}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0603848d-34b5-4a12-8e1e-304a065d4f3b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 9. The 8 Gelfand-Tsetlin points, and why no 8x8 measure M(x,y) can exist. ---- *)\nClearAll[gtPts, mir, PsiBg, PsiAmir, PsiAsame, PsiAshift, dualCands, solveM, mres, rankTab];\n(* {{x21},{x11,x12}} in units of h above theta; the x22 of the earlier cells is renamed x12 *)\ngtPts = {{2, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 0}, {2, 1, 1}, {2, 1, 0}, {2, 0, 0}, {1, 1, 1}, {1, 1, 0}, {1, 0, 0}};\nmir[{a_, b_, c_}] := {2 - a, 2 - b, 2 - c};\nPsiBg = PsiB /@ gtPts;\nPsiAmir = PsiA /@ (mir /@ gtPts);\nPsiAsame = PsiA /@ gtPts;\nPsiAshift = Table[qd[1, p[[1]] + 1] (qd[1, p[[2]] + 1] qd[2, p[[3]]] - qd[2, p[[2]] + 1] qd[1, p[[3]]]), {p, gtPts}];\ndualCands = {\"mirror lattice, +h\" -> PsiAmir, \"same lattice, +h\" -> PsiAsame, \"lattice +h, -h form\" -> PsiAshift};\nsolveM[dualBas_] := Module[{mm, ans, vs, eqs, sol},\n   mm = Array[mval, {8, 8}];\n   ans = Expand[Sum[mm[[a, b]] dualBas[[a]] PsiBg[[b]], {a, 8}, {b, 8}]];\n   vs = Union@Cases[{detN[trGood], ans}, qu[_, _] | qd[_, _], Infinity];\n   eqs = Thread[Last /@ CoefficientRules[Expand[detN[trGood] - ans], vs] == 0];\n   sol = Solve[eqs, Flatten[mm]];\n   If[sol === {}, \"NO SOLUTION\", mm /. First[sol]]];\nmres = Table[c[[1]] -> solveM[c[[2]]], {c, dualCands}];\n(* the obstruction is a rank count, independent of any dual convention *)\nrankTab = {\n   {\"GT points sample the directs at n =\", Union[Cases[PsiBg, qu[_, n_] :> n, Infinity]]},\n   {\"residues sample the directs at n =\", Union[Cases[rowM /@ allRows, qu[_, n_] :> n, Infinity]]},\n   {\"Schmidt rank of det N (direct side)\", MatrixRank[Last[coefMat[Values[splitSides[detN[trGood]]]]]]},\n   {\"dim span of the 8 GT wave functions Psi^B\", MatrixRank[Last[coefMat[PsiBg]]]},\n   {\"dim span of Psi^B over the full 27-point cube\", MatrixRank[Last[coefMat[PsiB /@ confs]]]},\n   {\"direct side inside the 8-point GT span?\", And @@ (inSpanQ[#, PsiBg] & /@ Values[splitSides[detN[trGood]]])},\n   {\"8x8 solve, per dual family\", Column[Table[mres[[k, 1]] -> If[StringQ[mres[[k, 2]]], \"NO SOLUTION\", \"SOLVED\"], {k, Length[mres]}]]}};\nGrid[rankTab, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"639557\" data-output-id=\"18\" data-out-n=\"111\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"27\" data-sub-end=\"27\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[111]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"18\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.84em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GT points sample the directs at n =</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">residues sample the directs at n =</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Schmidt rank of det N (direct side)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim span of the 8 GT wave functions Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim span of Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">B over the full 27-point cube</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">direct side inside the 8-point GT span?</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">8x8 solve, per dual family</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.46em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">17</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.86em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mirror lattice, +h</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO SOLUTION</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same lattice, +h</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO SOLUTION</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lattice +h, -h form</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NO SOLUTION</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:10.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-13.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.65em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[111]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{GT points sample the directs at n =} & \\left\\{-1,0,1,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{residues sample the directs at n =} & \\left\\{-1,0,1,2\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{Schmidt rank of det N (direct side)} & 16\\\\\\hline\\text{dim span of the 8 GT wave functions Psi\\^{}B} & 8\\\\\\hline\\text{dim span of Psi\\^{}B over the full 27-point cube} & 17\\\\\\hline\\text{direct side inside the 8-point GT span?} & \\mathrm{False}\\\\\\hline\\text{8x8 solve, per dual family} & \\begin{matrix}\\text{mirror lattice, +h}\\to \\text{NO SOLUTION}\\\\\\text{same lattice, +h}\\to \\text{NO SOLUTION}\\\\\\text{lattice +h, -h form}\\to \\text{NO SOLUTION}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "1c4279a6-a6e9-419e-9b1c-174f0e7ee001"
    }
